World model: The HUD top row currently contains 11 N cells followed by W cells. The level appears to finish when the N segment disappears.
Goal: Reduce the N segment to zero.
Plan: Press RIGHT 11 times to convert the remaining N cells to W, then press SPACE (if needed) to confirm level completion. We'll execute the 11 RIGHT actions now.
{
  "code": "action(['RIGHT']*11, intent='solve')"
}

